  "details": "I suggest to add more context for these strings, references:\n\nDeposits:\n\n - When talking about deposits, for buyer side it filtered your credits purchase, and for seller it means the in-come you get from marketplace.\n\nPurchases:\n\n - For both about buyers and sellers, \"Purchases\" meaning for the out-come of your wallet, or in other word, is about what you've bought from marketplace.\n\nSelf:\n\n - When you were buying your own stuffs from your own store, it will appear as \"Self\" in the \"Recipient\" col.\n\nRecipient:\n\n - In short, in a transaction, you are the \"Sender\" (Provider) and the other person involved in this transaction is the \"Recipient\".\n\nAs well, I would suggest adding tooltips for \"Deposits\" and \"Purchases\" buttons, which could include the above info to make it easier for users and translators to better understand what they are using for.",
